WEBVTT

00:11.000 --> 00:14.990
Happy birthday to you.

00:15.080 --> 00:19.090
Happy birthday to you.

00:19.190 --> 00:23.250
Happy birthday to you.

00:23.350 --> 00:27.230
Happy birthday to you.

00:27.370 --> 00:31.210
Happy birthday to you.

00:31.320 --> 00:37.600
Happy birthday to you.

00:38.350 --> 00:40.050
A Happy Birthday song

00:40.110 --> 00:42.280
dedicated to the leader

00:42.320 --> 00:43.470
of our Rongcheng Group,

00:43.470 --> 00:44.820
-Mr. Zhou Rong.
Where's Qiqi?

00:44.820 --> 00:47.940
-Qiqi is on the stage.
-Mr. Zhou, happy birthday

00:48.000 --> 00:50.240
and may you have many more.

00:50.470 --> 00:51.670
Mr. Rong,

00:51.920 --> 00:54.930
-happy birthday!
-Happy birthday!

00:58.350 --> 00:59.380
Thank you!

00:59.600 --> 01:00.600
Let's party!

01:08.150 --> 01:08.680
This is

01:09.789 --> 01:11.460
a cake of the Eastern New City?

01:11.640 --> 01:12.340
Yeah.

01:13.150 --> 01:14.280
Whose idea was this?

01:21.120 --> 01:21.680
Mr. Rong,

01:22.280 --> 01:24.610
I had this specially made for you.

01:25.310 --> 01:26.400
Rongcheng will definitely

01:26.400 --> 01:27.730
take this piece of land.

01:34.950 --> 01:35.710
Bowen,

01:37.900 --> 01:39.100
so thoughtful of you.

01:40.150 --> 01:41.460
Eastern New City

01:41.710 --> 01:42.509
is indeed

01:43.400 --> 01:44.860
a big piece of cake.

01:46.870 --> 01:48.590
Turn the music down.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.590
Let me tell you a joke!

01:51.150 --> 01:51.710
Okay.

01:51.710 --> 01:54.430
A piece of cake got lost.

01:54.759 --> 01:55.759
Who encouraged it

01:55.789 --> 01:59.650
to get back on the right path?

01:59.950 --> 02:02.250
Raise your hand if you know.

02:08.710 --> 02:09.669
Do you know?

02:12.590 --> 02:13.590
College student?

02:17.270 --> 02:17.870
It's me.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.840
He said it's him.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.870
Mr. Rong, don't keep us in suspense.

02:26.870 --> 02:27.700
What is it?

02:27.910 --> 02:28.370
It's...

02:29.160 --> 02:30.370
It's...

02:30.400 --> 02:31.070
a pig.

02:31.590 --> 02:32.660
A pig!

02:32.960 --> 02:33.520
Pig?

02:33.960 --> 02:34.910
Why, Mr. Rong?

02:35.430 --> 02:36.240
Because

02:36.560 --> 02:39.700
it's a chonk-alate cake!

02:41.840 --> 02:42.700
Is it not funny?

02:45.920 --> 02:48.140
He even said it was him. Honestly.

04:12.890 --> 04:16.620
[Born with Luck]

04:16.690 --> 04:19.600
[Episode 2]

04:20.420 --> 04:23.620
[Sanjiangkou]

04:30.870 --> 04:31.400
Chief Qi.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.120
Yi'ang.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.260
We finally got you here.

04:34.090 --> 04:35.040
[Qi Zhenxing, Chief of
Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

04:35.290 --> 04:36.220
Long time no see.

04:36.680 --> 04:38.190
We'll be working together from now on.

04:38.190 --> 04:38.640
No,

04:38.950 --> 04:40.409
I will follow your orders.

04:41.630 --> 04:43.750
This is Li Qian, the colleague I brought.

04:43.750 --> 04:44.070
Hello.

04:44.070 --> 04:44.630
Hello, Chief Qi.

04:44.630 --> 04:45.430
Hello.

04:46.690 --> 04:48.000
Song, Song Xing.

04:48.190 --> 04:48.750
This is the person

04:48.750 --> 04:49.920
Ye specifically chose for you.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.950
You just arrived here.

04:50.950 --> 04:52.240
There are many things you don't know.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.040
For anything,

04:53.070 --> 04:54.000
anytime, anywhere,

04:54.000 --> 04:54.870
you can look for him.

04:54.870 --> 04:56.370
Chief Zhang, I'm always on call.

04:54.930 --> 04:56.380
[Song Xing, Investigator of
Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

04:56.909 --> 04:57.310
Hello.

04:58.270 --> 04:59.800
Where are Ye and the others?

05:00.300 --> 05:01.860
-Ye.
-Captain Ye said he's sick.

05:01.860 --> 05:03.290
Deputy Captain Wang is also sick.

05:03.290 --> 05:04.070
People in the bureau

05:04.070 --> 05:05.200
are almost all sick.

05:05.830 --> 05:06.560
It's the flu.

05:07.160 --> 05:09.020
They are indeed holding a grudge.

05:09.410 --> 05:10.620
I told you.

05:11.730 --> 05:13.130
They all took sick leave?

05:13.530 --> 05:14.660
No, no.

05:15.350 --> 05:17.150
Everyone is working while sick.

05:17.420 --> 05:19.240
The bureau has an operation these days

05:19.240 --> 05:22.100
to support the traffic police
in checking for DUIs.

05:22.320 --> 05:23.650
After this busy period,

05:24.160 --> 05:25.040
we will

05:25.070 --> 05:26.330
welcome you properly.

05:29.520 --> 05:30.440
Chief Qi, I...

05:33.480 --> 05:35.480
I still want to hurry up

05:36.120 --> 05:38.030
and verify the report letter.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.800
I don't want my temporary appointment

05:39.800 --> 05:40.720
as the deputy chief

05:40.720 --> 05:41.800
to cause any

05:41.800 --> 05:44.000
unnecessary misunderstandings here.

05:45.950 --> 05:46.310
Sure.

05:46.800 --> 05:47.270
Sure.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.560
Unload the luggage.

05:49.560 --> 05:49.920
Okay.

05:52.890 --> 05:53.640
Let me do it.

05:54.750 --> 05:55.210
Yi'ang,

05:55.800 --> 05:56.500
the office is upstairs.

05:56.500 --> 05:56.920
Okay.

05:57.120 --> 05:57.650
Let's go.

05:58.580 --> 05:59.250
Thank you.

06:01.630 --> 06:02.310
Welcome.

06:06.430 --> 06:08.390
[Ye Jian, Detective Captain
of Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

06:08.070 --> 06:08.610
Ye.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.110
Let's eat.

06:11.310 --> 06:12.360
I'm not eating.

06:12.480 --> 06:13.880
I have no appetite at all.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.080
It's not that serious, is it?

06:18.240 --> 06:18.680
Yes,

06:19.310 --> 06:20.130
[Wang Ruijun]

06:19.560 --> 06:20.750
considering everything,

06:20.160 --> 06:21.130
[Detective Deputy Captain
of Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

06:20.830 --> 06:21.680
the position of deputy chief

06:21.680 --> 06:22.610
should be yours.

06:23.630 --> 06:25.160
But Zhang Yi'ang is already here.

06:25.160 --> 06:25.950
Isn't embarassing him like this

06:25.950 --> 06:26.800
a bit much?

06:26.830 --> 06:28.830
I'm not sulking about the position.

06:29.870 --> 06:31.240
Do you know that Zhang Yi'ang

06:31.240 --> 06:32.640
came here with a mission?

06:34.680 --> 06:36.680
They say the provincial department

06:37.430 --> 06:39.800
found a half of a report letter,

06:40.070 --> 06:41.510
saying Chief Lu's death wasn't an accident

06:41.510 --> 06:42.909
and that he was murdered.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.950
He's just here to review

06:44.950 --> 06:45.820
this case.

06:45.860 --> 06:48.140
[Captain's Office]

06:45.950 --> 06:46.510
It's fine if Zhang Yi'ang wants to

06:46.510 --> 06:47.800
make a comeback,

06:48.350 --> 06:49.159
but there's no need to use such

06:49.159 --> 06:50.360
despicable methods.

06:50.830 --> 06:52.000
So you assigned Song Xing, a rookie,

06:52.000 --> 06:52.430
to him?

06:52.560 --> 06:55.290
Giving him anyone
is a waste of police resources.

07:01.950 --> 07:02.410
Come in.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.490
Captain Ye.

07:07.330 --> 07:08.530
Captain Wang is here?

07:08.560 --> 07:09.120
Long time no see.

07:09.120 --> 07:09.560
Caught a cold.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.390
Caught a cold.

07:10.390 --> 07:11.390
Yes, I've heard.

07:11.430 --> 07:12.120
Well,

07:12.390 --> 07:13.600
tomorrow is the 100-Day Operation.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.190
We need to work with

07:14.190 --> 07:15.800
the traffic police to check for DUIs.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.720
It's an urgent task.

07:16.720 --> 07:17.360
So Ye and I

07:17.360 --> 07:18.870
are just making arrangements

07:18.870 --> 07:19.560
and didn't go to pick you up.

07:19.560 --> 07:19.950
It's fine.

07:19.950 --> 07:20.560
It's nothing.

07:20.560 --> 07:20.830
Sit here.

07:20.830 --> 07:21.310
You first.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.110
I'll sit here.

07:22.190 --> 07:22.510
I'll sit here.

07:22.510 --> 07:23.630
I haven't eaten this yet,

07:23.630 --> 07:24.000
Chief Zhang.

07:24.000 --> 07:25.090
Come, eat while it's hot.

07:25.090 --> 07:25.950
I ate on the way.

07:26.160 --> 07:26.560
Thank you.

07:26.560 --> 07:27.490
You're welcome.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.380
Let's talk while eating.

07:28.380 --> 07:29.360
Okay.

07:30.870 --> 07:32.400
I came here on short notice.

07:36.130 --> 07:37.600
Coming to Sanjiangkou is really like

07:37.600 --> 07:40.260
being forced to do something
beyond my ability.

07:40.480 --> 07:41.630
It's urgent. Mainly because it's urgent.

07:41.630 --> 07:43.159
The provincial department

07:43.159 --> 07:44.600
did receive a

07:44.600 --> 07:45.190
report letter.

07:45.190 --> 07:46.990
You guys have heard about it too.

07:47.270 --> 07:48.670
The letter suspects that

07:49.000 --> 07:50.110
Chief Lu's death

07:50.240 --> 07:51.370
was not an accident.

07:52.750 --> 07:53.560
Chief Zhang,

07:54.360 --> 07:56.090
do you think it was an accident?

07:57.680 --> 07:58.680
I've never doubted

07:58.680 --> 08:00.540
your investigation conclusion.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.380
It's mainly Director Gao.

08:02.750 --> 08:03.630
Because he

08:04.240 --> 08:05.100
mentioned that

08:05.120 --> 08:07.580
he suspects
the cause of Chief Lu's death...

08:08.270 --> 08:09.200
could be murder.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.620
And one more thing.

08:15.680 --> 08:17.510
It said that after Chief Lu passed away,

08:17.510 --> 08:18.040
I

08:19.120 --> 08:21.060
once spoke about

08:21.250 --> 08:22.750
doubting of doubts in public.

08:22.750 --> 08:23.480
Chief Zhang,

08:24.680 --> 08:25.920
could it be that someone

08:25.920 --> 08:27.580
intentionally wants to muddy

08:27.600 --> 08:28.360
the waters?

08:33.580 --> 08:35.000
At that time, you thought

08:35.200 --> 08:36.030
this was

08:36.480 --> 08:37.010
a murder?

08:37.440 --> 08:39.240
I didn't think this was a murder.

08:39.780 --> 08:41.250
Then why did you say that?

08:41.789 --> 08:43.809
I just wanted to make a brief summary

08:43.840 --> 08:45.840
of Chief Lu's life.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.250
We are cops.

08:47.390 --> 08:49.080
We have to doubt things every day.

08:49.080 --> 08:49.540
But

08:50.000 --> 08:51.000
if we have doubts,

08:51.080 --> 08:52.480
does it mean we are right?

08:53.240 --> 08:54.150
So we still need to

08:54.150 --> 08:55.240
doubt our doubts.

08:56.200 --> 08:56.630
But if we

08:56.630 --> 08:57.950
doubt our doubts,

08:58.080 --> 08:59.390
are we definitely right?

08:59.390 --> 09:00.390
Not necessarily.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.480
So we have to continue to

09:01.480 --> 09:03.140
doubt the doubt of our doubts.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.280
Okay.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.270
When you read the poem,

09:06.270 --> 09:07.350
was it only people

09:07.550 --> 09:09.750
from the
Sanjiangkou Municipal Bureau present?

09:09.750 --> 09:10.080
Yes.

09:12.200 --> 09:18.020
♪ Doubt ♪

09:15.780 --> 09:17.280
What about this?

09:18.440 --> 09:19.200
After Chief Lu left,

09:19.200 --> 09:20.550
the position of Deputy Chief

09:20.550 --> 09:21.960
of Criminal Investigation

09:21.960 --> 09:23.150
at the Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau

09:23.150 --> 09:24.880
has been vacant for half a year.

09:25.240 --> 09:27.230
Could some comrades internally

09:27.270 --> 09:28.510
have some hard feelings

09:28.510 --> 09:30.170
and wrote that report letter?

09:30.850 --> 09:36.530
♪ Doubt ♪

09:31.270 --> 09:32.030
I'm just talking nonsense.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.030
Just some doubts.

09:36.190 --> 09:37.620
So I suspect

09:38.480 --> 09:39.610
this whistleblower

09:40.390 --> 09:41.600
was also present

09:41.630 --> 09:42.690
that day when I said

09:42.750 --> 09:43.610
this sentence.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.560
That is to say,

09:45.670 --> 09:48.030
it might be someone from our bureau.

09:49.590 --> 10:03.170
♪ Doubt the doubt of the doubt ♪

09:50.440 --> 09:50.960
Doubt.

09:52.750 --> 09:54.080
Doubt the doubt.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.910
Doubt the doubt of the doubt.

10:03.250 --> 10:04.410
♪ Doubt ♪

10:03.550 --> 10:04.150
Who?

10:05.600 --> 10:06.930
We need to investigate.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.300
Is it me or Wang?

10:08.440 --> 10:09.040
Not you.

10:09.320 --> 10:10.480
Nor would it be Wang.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.980
Because Chief Lu was your mentor.

10:11.980 --> 10:13.710
I believe you wouldn't do this.

10:14.870 --> 10:16.550
But the others need to be investigated.

10:16.550 --> 10:17.610
Well, Chief Zhang,

10:18.430 --> 10:19.380
I must correct

10:19.440 --> 10:20.460
what you said.

10:21.440 --> 10:23.450
Your "doubt of the doubt"

10:23.480 --> 10:24.240
isn't only known

10:24.240 --> 10:26.100
by the few at the meeting that day.

10:26.550 --> 10:27.840
This sentence

10:27.870 --> 10:28.810
has become a joke

10:28.840 --> 10:31.140
at Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau.

10:31.550 --> 10:32.080
Yeah.

10:32.150 --> 10:33.700
A joke?

10:34.030 --> 10:34.760
It's a meme?

10:34.790 --> 10:35.870
Everyone knows it.

10:37.630 --> 10:38.160
So,

10:38.270 --> 10:39.480
if you want to investigate this,

10:39.480 --> 10:41.080
you have to expand the scope.

10:41.270 --> 10:41.840
It's not just people

10:41.840 --> 10:43.080
from the
Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.910
It also includes

10:43.910 --> 10:44.960
people from
the municipal public security system,

10:44.960 --> 10:46.030
including their relatives

10:46.030 --> 10:46.600
and friends.

10:46.600 --> 10:47.080
All have to be investigated.

10:47.080 --> 10:47.680
Of course.

10:49.150 --> 10:51.080
But to tell the truth, Chief Zhang,

10:53.320 --> 10:54.670
I doubt there really is

10:54.670 --> 10:55.720
such a reporter.

11:02.270 --> 11:03.460
Well, Chief Zhang,

11:03.630 --> 11:05.000
whatever you want to investigate,
we'll cooperate.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.080
Song's cooperation alone

11:06.080 --> 11:06.820
is enough.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.960
I met Song. He's quite good.

11:09.960 --> 11:10.630
Then Chief Zhang,

11:10.630 --> 11:12.480
anything else I can help you with?

11:12.480 --> 11:12.840
No.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.900
Just came to say hi.

11:14.080 --> 11:15.360
Let's get this done quickly.

11:15.360 --> 11:15.760
Okay.

11:15.790 --> 11:16.910
-Okay.
-Go ahead.

11:17.240 --> 11:17.770
The food.

11:17.790 --> 11:18.840
You eat, Chief Zhang.

11:18.840 --> 11:19.970
I've already eaten.

11:31.870 --> 11:34.280
Happy birthday!

11:36.290 --> 11:38.210
[Zhou Rong, Chairman of Rongcheng Group]

11:41.550 --> 11:43.170
Ye still isn't here?

11:44.240 --> 11:45.640
You know him.

11:46.200 --> 11:47.390
He's a civil servant.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.500
He can't make it.

11:48.960 --> 11:49.690
Isn't he about to become

11:49.690 --> 11:50.690
the deputy chief?

11:50.790 --> 11:51.650
Who can stop him

11:51.670 --> 11:52.820
from coming to have a casual meal?

11:52.570 --> 11:54.510
[Lang Bowen, General Manager of Aotu]

11:57.510 --> 11:58.310
What's wrong?

11:58.720 --> 12:01.300
[Hu Jianren, Secretary of the Chairman
of Rongcheng Group]

11:59.030 --> 11:59.680
Mr. Rong,

12:00.320 --> 12:01.270
I heard

12:01.840 --> 12:03.380
the province has assigned

12:03.440 --> 12:06.100
a new police chief
of criminal investigations.

12:07.390 --> 12:09.030
Assigned a new person?

12:10.240 --> 12:11.300
From the province?

12:12.760 --> 12:13.690
Where did you hear that?

12:13.690 --> 12:15.200
It's already been publicly announced.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.750
The new chief's name is

12:16.790 --> 12:17.590
Zhang Yi'ang.

12:17.810 --> 12:19.470
[Lu Yibo, General Manager
of Fenglin Night Hotel]

12:18.270 --> 12:19.440
Zhang Yi'ang...

12:21.360 --> 12:21.990
Zhang Yi'ang?

12:21.990 --> 12:23.650
Have I heard this name before?

12:24.000 --> 12:24.350
Yes.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.240
He used to live

12:25.270 --> 12:26.200
in Sanjiangkou.

12:28.630 --> 12:29.320
Is it that

12:29.320 --> 12:31.340
"doubt the doubt of the doubt"?

12:31.360 --> 12:31.930
Yes.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.150
What kind of wind

12:36.150 --> 12:38.010
blew this doubtful guy over here?

12:38.270 --> 12:38.910
Well,

12:39.550 --> 12:40.480
I wouldn't know.

12:43.440 --> 12:43.960
Bowen.

12:45.080 --> 12:46.610
I have a good bottle of wine.

12:46.670 --> 12:47.330
Come get it.

12:50.910 --> 12:51.840
Come, Yangyang.

12:52.630 --> 12:53.120
Ren.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.040
Come, Ren.

12:54.150 --> 12:54.610
Cheers.

13:21.720 --> 13:22.670
Ye has

13:22.960 --> 13:24.270
suffered in Sanjiangkou
for so many years.

13:24.270 --> 13:26.400
He should have made it to the top by now.

13:26.480 --> 13:28.080
Why is there a new person now?

13:29.630 --> 13:31.600
I told him to build some connections
long ago,

13:31.600 --> 13:33.200
but he just wouldn't listen.

13:33.390 --> 13:35.390
Didn't you understand what I meant?

13:37.010 --> 13:38.310
I was saying...

13:42.450 --> 13:43.170
Mr. Rong,

13:44.030 --> 13:45.360
no need to be so nervous.

13:46.150 --> 13:47.880
It's just a new chief, isn't it?

13:55.790 --> 13:59.930
[Ye Jian]
[I can't come. Happy birthday from afar.]

14:02.600 --> 14:03.660
A deputy chief came

14:03.670 --> 14:06.080
and he's immediately staying away
to avoid suspicion.

14:06.080 --> 14:06.720
Why?

14:08.080 --> 14:09.690
That matter was very clear.

14:10.000 --> 14:12.200
It had absolutely nothing to do with us.

14:12.200 --> 14:12.600
Ye said

14:12.600 --> 14:13.790
they investigated it clearly.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.520
No, what kind of person is Ye?

14:15.550 --> 14:16.490
He's our bro.

14:17.440 --> 14:18.590
That's true,

14:18.630 --> 14:19.790
but Ye is also a cop.

14:22.150 --> 14:23.360
Then let me put it this way,

14:23.360 --> 14:24.490
if you broke the law,

14:24.910 --> 14:25.910
based on emotion,

14:26.510 --> 14:28.240
do you think Ye would let you go?

14:39.960 --> 14:40.390
Hey,

14:40.410 --> 14:41.670
I just don't understand.

14:41.670 --> 14:42.510
Why can't we stay

14:41.870 --> 14:44.910
[Lintao Motel]

14:42.550 --> 14:43.870
without an ID?

14:44.120 --> 14:45.080
I'm the one staying here,

14:45.080 --> 14:46.190
not the ID card.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.170
This is the rule.

14:50.910 --> 14:51.730
I predict

14:51.790 --> 14:53.720
the motel business will get harder

14:53.910 --> 14:55.870
because these rules are getting stricter.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.740
During the day,

14:56.790 --> 14:58.180
we already suffered in the train aisle

14:58.180 --> 14:59.020
for hours.

14:59.150 --> 15:00.040
At night,

15:00.080 --> 15:02.030
we can't just sleep on the street, right?

15:02.030 --> 15:02.840
Even if we stay in a hotel,

15:02.840 --> 15:03.750
the money we have

15:03.750 --> 15:05.280
is only enough for two days.

15:05.320 --> 15:07.180
Then we need to get money quickly.

15:08.960 --> 15:09.550
As for getting money,

15:09.550 --> 15:11.150
I've already figured it out.

15:13.860 --> 15:17.360
[Chuanshi Antique Collections]

15:19.040 --> 15:20.700
Are we selling the goods here?

15:22.390 --> 15:23.670
But you make a good point.

15:23.670 --> 15:24.410
Not resting well

15:24.410 --> 15:25.640
will affect our work.

15:27.030 --> 15:28.050
I believe in this world,

15:28.050 --> 15:29.390
there are always people like us

15:28.690 --> 15:30.460
[Dayou Motel]

15:29.720 --> 15:32.050
who run hotels and don't follow the rules.

15:32.140 --> 15:33.530
[Pingshun Motel]

15:33.590 --> 15:34.750
[Motel]

15:37.370 --> 15:41.740
[Peach]

15:44.630 --> 15:45.450
Two rooms?

15:45.480 --> 15:46.080
One.

15:47.870 --> 15:49.080
This is a love hotel.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.240
There's only one bed.

15:50.240 --> 15:51.370
And it's a waterbed.

15:51.750 --> 15:52.720
Motorized.

15:52.910 --> 15:54.170
As long as we can sleep.

15:58.260 --> 15:59.790
ID cards for registration.

16:04.620 --> 16:06.480
We left in a hurry and forgot them.

16:07.080 --> 16:09.140
Fifty extra per person without an ID.

16:09.200 --> 16:09.870
That's a rip-off.

16:09.870 --> 16:11.200
A hundred extra for two?

16:12.550 --> 16:14.950
Calculated per day.
Are you staying or not?

16:17.790 --> 16:18.240
Yes.

16:30.630 --> 16:32.090
I told Song Xing

16:32.270 --> 16:33.440
we'll start investigating

16:33.440 --> 16:34.970
Chief Lu's case file today.

16:35.720 --> 16:36.360
Song Xing said

16:36.360 --> 16:37.270
he wouldn't be back until noon

16:37.270 --> 16:38.670
to help us pull the files.

16:39.790 --> 16:40.510
Aren't they supposed to fully

16:40.510 --> 16:41.570
cooperate with us?

16:41.750 --> 16:43.000
He said they're short-handed.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.960
He and Captain Ye went to

16:43.960 --> 16:46.090
the traffic police team for a meeting.

16:46.910 --> 16:48.150
Assisting the traffic police?

16:48.150 --> 16:50.150
Great, great, great.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.090
Much better.

16:55.150 --> 16:55.880
Much better.

16:59.680 --> 17:01.990
[Chuanshi Antique Collections]

17:00.210 --> 17:04.670
♪ Burning on its own
somewhere between haziness and clarity ♪

17:02.020 --> 17:04.780
[Peach Night Hotel]

17:07.880 --> 17:12.109
[Chuanshi Antique Collections]

17:08.540 --> 17:14.790
♪ In the careless detail,
he touched the color ♪

17:18.890 --> 17:21.160
♪ The show starts getting interesting ♪

17:23.339 --> 17:25.460
♪ I wonder who's the real onlooker here ♪

17:27.619 --> 17:29.610
♪ Find the onlooker ♪

17:35.720 --> 17:36.990
It's authentic, but...

17:36.990 --> 17:41.320
[Zheng Yongbing, Independent Collector]

17:37.510 --> 17:38.380
My friends,

17:39.070 --> 17:40.920
do you have receipts for these?

17:42.030 --> 17:43.240
What if we do?

17:43.360 --> 17:44.740
What if we don't?

17:45.850 --> 17:48.550
There was an explosion
in the provincial capital a few days ago.

17:48.550 --> 17:49.610
Haven't you heard?

17:52.630 --> 17:53.630
And then?

17:53.920 --> 17:54.740
A jewelry store

17:54.740 --> 17:56.420
was robbed by a man and a woman.

17:56.750 --> 17:57.930
We're both men.

17:58.200 --> 17:58.790
Yes.

17:59.680 --> 18:00.830
I'm just afraid

18:00.850 --> 18:02.910
they are from a questionable source.

18:07.330 --> 18:08.660
Can you take them or not?

18:13.810 --> 18:14.990
Take it easy.

18:16.000 --> 18:16.660
I can.

18:17.690 --> 18:18.350
I can.

18:19.270 --> 18:21.200
It's not easy for us to do business.

18:22.830 --> 18:24.100
Since you can take it,

18:27.320 --> 18:28.440
take this too.

18:38.110 --> 18:39.350
This stone statue...

18:39.400 --> 18:40.400
What is it made of?

18:45.150 --> 18:45.780
Jade.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.370
A jade statue.

18:52.030 --> 18:52.790
My friends,

18:53.400 --> 18:54.860
how much do you want for it?

19:08.830 --> 19:09.270
Chief,

19:09.830 --> 19:10.750
the first interrogation

19:10.750 --> 19:11.880
of the offending driver

19:11.880 --> 19:13.210
was indeed not recorded

19:13.270 --> 19:14.200
because the bureau's system

19:14.200 --> 19:15.440
was being upgraded at the time.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.800
We weren't familiar with it yet,

19:16.800 --> 19:17.860
so it wasn't saved.

19:18.070 --> 19:19.240
Other than the first interrogation,

19:19.240 --> 19:20.900
the rest of the files are here.

19:23.060 --> 19:23.680
So many.

19:24.220 --> 19:26.350
The archive room's fire safety system
is being upgraded,

19:26.350 --> 19:27.310
so the files are temporarily stored

19:27.310 --> 19:28.570
in the warehouse here.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.110
To find the files for Chief Lu's case,

19:30.110 --> 19:31.830
you'll have to rely on yourself.

19:31.830 --> 19:32.550
Or...

19:32.830 --> 19:34.110
you can wait half a month.

19:34.110 --> 19:35.510
Once the archive room is sorted out,

19:35.510 --> 19:36.910
it'll be easier to find things.

19:36.910 --> 19:37.640
Half a month?

19:39.070 --> 19:40.300
Was the archive room

19:40.440 --> 19:41.900
upgraded on short notice?

19:44.110 --> 19:45.050
For the specifics,

19:45.050 --> 19:47.270
you'll have to ask
Chief Qi and Captain Ye.

19:47.270 --> 19:48.270
There are so many.

19:48.790 --> 19:49.480
We need some manpower

19:49.480 --> 19:50.340
to help us look.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.790
There is definitely no manpower available.

19:51.790 --> 19:53.070
Captain Ye took everyone in the bureau

19:53.070 --> 19:54.800
for the DUI operation tonight.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.610
Chen's Chicken Racks.

20:01.830 --> 20:04.090
I'm talking about Chen's Chicken Racks.

20:04.160 --> 20:04.920
Their chicken racks

20:04.920 --> 20:06.270
take 40 minutes to fry.

20:06.610 --> 20:07.800
You even have to wait in line.

20:07.800 --> 20:09.730
I'll take you to try it another day.

20:09.830 --> 20:10.790
If you are really busy,

20:10.790 --> 20:12.310
you wouldn't spend two hours

20:12.310 --> 20:13.270
at noon

20:13.310 --> 20:15.040
just to eat some chicken racks.

20:18.470 --> 20:19.110
How did you know

20:19.110 --> 20:20.170
I was eating there?

20:21.400 --> 20:23.600
I know all the good food in Sanjiangkou.

20:24.510 --> 20:26.110
I still remember the flavors

20:26.310 --> 20:27.360
of the few barbecue shops,

20:27.360 --> 20:29.290
especially Chen's Chicken Racks.

20:29.750 --> 20:32.280
Can't believe they haven't
changed the chef.

20:37.310 --> 20:37.840
As for me,

20:38.960 --> 20:41.020
I came to Sanjiangkou out of nowhere.

20:41.750 --> 20:43.610
The comrades don't trust me much.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.640
I can understand.

20:45.400 --> 20:47.230
But if it delays work,

20:47.510 --> 20:48.970
that won't be good, right?

20:52.270 --> 20:52.950
I'll help you find it.

20:52.950 --> 20:53.670
No need.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.180
This will deepen the comrades'

20:55.180 --> 20:56.580
misunderstanding of me.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.260
Go do your work.

20:59.270 --> 20:59.800
Go ahead.

21:08.960 --> 21:09.720
Chief,

21:09.850 --> 21:10.590
I'll look for it.

21:10.590 --> 21:11.750
You go watch the video.

21:11.750 --> 21:12.680
Can you do it alone?

21:12.680 --> 21:13.410
Don't worry.

21:15.790 --> 21:16.230
Okay.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.110
Okay.

21:38.310 --> 21:38.790
One.

21:40.090 --> 21:41.180
Push.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.900
Watch your breathing.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.210
Okay, squeeze.

21:46.740 --> 21:48.320
Good, very good.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.400
Okay, push.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.090
Go, exhale.

21:52.000 --> 21:52.550
Squeeze.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.700
-Come on. Go on.
-Mr. Rong.

21:55.780 --> 21:57.110
Time for your medicine.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.550
Why only one pill?

21:59.110 --> 22:00.050
You've been working out for a while.

22:00.050 --> 22:01.480
You've let off enough steam.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.880
The doctor said you have bipolar disorder.

22:02.880 --> 22:04.670
You can't just rely on medication.

22:04.670 --> 22:06.470
I have too many things on my mind.

22:07.070 --> 22:07.640
Since Bowen got

22:07.640 --> 22:08.720
the Aotu subsidiary,

22:08.720 --> 22:10.180
he's gotten a lot of ideas.

22:10.400 --> 22:11.890
Yibo runs Fenglin Night

22:12.070 --> 22:14.330
and revolves around his woman every day.

22:15.080 --> 22:17.040
That guy named Zhang got transferred back.

22:17.040 --> 22:18.370
Nothing is going right.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.750
Did you find out why Zhang

22:24.960 --> 22:26.420
came back to Sanjiangkou?

22:26.960 --> 22:27.400
No.

22:27.810 --> 22:29.680
Should we ask Captain Ye?

22:30.270 --> 22:31.200
Absolutely not.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.050
When Lu was alive,

22:33.310 --> 22:34.200
he thought Ye and I

22:34.200 --> 22:35.750
were trading money for power.

22:35.750 --> 22:37.200
We're just friends who grew up together.

22:37.200 --> 22:38.720
Can't cause trouble for him.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.180
You value relationships.

22:40.640 --> 22:41.200
Mr. Rong,

22:41.400 --> 22:42.750
if anything else happens,

22:42.750 --> 22:44.610
I'll still take the blame for you.

22:46.880 --> 22:47.470
Jianren.

22:48.480 --> 22:50.240
We've known each other the shortest,

22:50.240 --> 22:51.040
but in the end,

22:51.550 --> 22:53.010
you're the most reliable.

22:56.960 --> 22:57.510
Mr. Rong.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.760
We've been a bit unlucky lately.

23:01.510 --> 23:03.110
Should I hire a fengshui master?

23:03.110 --> 23:04.030
We can spend some money.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.640
As the saying goes,
money prevents disasters.

23:05.640 --> 23:06.970
Let's fix the fengshui.

23:07.290 --> 23:07.830
Okay.

23:08.590 --> 23:09.790
You handle this.

23:11.030 --> 23:11.890
Shuangshuang!

23:12.890 --> 23:13.520
Come on.

23:13.720 --> 23:15.430
You've gotten stronger recently.

23:15.430 --> 23:16.430
Adjust this rope.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.010
Okay, go.

23:21.160 --> 23:21.590
One.

23:22.830 --> 23:23.350
Two.

23:24.010 --> 23:25.270
Watch your breathing.

23:26.440 --> 23:27.520
Go, squeeze.

23:34.640 --> 23:38.090
[Anzhi Road, Sanjiangkou City,
Ping'an Province]

23:52.880 --> 23:53.340
Come in.

23:56.640 --> 23:57.960
I've finished reading.

23:57.960 --> 23:58.600
That fast?

23:58.880 --> 23:59.810
Inspired by you.

23:59.880 --> 24:00.350
If someone

24:00.350 --> 24:01.640
wanted to make things difficult for us,

24:01.640 --> 24:02.590
they would definitely hide the files

24:02.590 --> 24:03.600
in the very back.

24:03.960 --> 24:05.550
I went straight to the boxes in the back,

24:05.550 --> 24:06.880
and found them quickly.

24:09.000 --> 24:10.480
The driver who caused the accident
is Shen Gang.

24:10.480 --> 24:12.020
The file clearly records that

24:11.110 --> 24:12.940
[List of Road Traffic Accident]

24:12.110 --> 24:13.800
as he was approaching the intersection,

24:13.800 --> 24:14.680
he was blinded by the high beams

24:14.680 --> 24:15.760
of an oncoming vehicle.

24:15.760 --> 24:16.600
He didn't see

24:16.680 --> 24:17.590
the intersection light

24:17.590 --> 24:18.680
turn red,

24:19.000 --> 24:20.460
so he hit Chief Lu.

24:21.060 --> 24:22.750
The police handling the case
previously suspected

24:22.750 --> 24:23.590
that the driver who flashed high beams

24:23.590 --> 24:24.980
at Shen Gang

24:25.000 --> 24:26.930
might have had an ulterior motive.

24:27.510 --> 24:28.450
Later, it was verified

24:28.450 --> 24:30.180
that it was indeed an accident.

24:30.720 --> 24:31.870
But I think

24:32.750 --> 24:34.070
it's still necessary to have Shen Gang

24:34.070 --> 24:35.000
come over again.

24:39.880 --> 24:40.640
They must've already asked

24:40.640 --> 24:42.500
many questions about the driver.

24:43.720 --> 24:44.200
Having Shen Gang come over

24:44.200 --> 24:46.200
probably won't get us anything new.

24:46.960 --> 24:47.590
I really want to find this driver

24:47.590 --> 24:48.680
who turned on the high beams.

24:48.680 --> 24:50.480
and bring him in for questioning again.

24:50.480 --> 24:51.680
The driver with the high beams?

24:51.680 --> 24:52.750
They already asked him too.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.550
Ask him again.

24:54.400 --> 24:55.660
We're just verifying.

25:01.840 --> 25:04.380
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

25:02.410 --> 25:03.020
Come in.

25:07.960 --> 25:09.440
This operation against

25:09.480 --> 25:10.290
drunk driving

25:10.440 --> 25:12.070
is led by the Traffic Police Department,

25:12.070 --> 25:13.200
and supported by the CID.

25:13.200 --> 25:14.530
It's a joint operation.

25:14.790 --> 25:16.430
I will supervise the team.

25:16.570 --> 25:18.330
We'll act at 7:00 PM tonight.

25:18.540 --> 25:19.560
Now, let me

25:19.590 --> 25:20.590
assign the tasks.

25:20.640 --> 25:21.490
My car

25:22.230 --> 25:23.360
is fully automatic.

25:23.680 --> 25:25.250
It's really annoying.

25:25.340 --> 25:26.080
That day,

25:26.160 --> 25:27.020
it was raining,

25:27.750 --> 25:28.950
and the road was dark.

25:29.320 --> 25:30.710
It's a flagship SUV.

25:30.840 --> 25:31.880
Fully automatic!

25:32.200 --> 25:34.280
It just turned the high beams on
automatically.

25:34.280 --> 25:35.760
Maybe

25:35.800 --> 25:37.160
it shined on that guy.

25:38.790 --> 25:39.510
I... I already told you

25:39.510 --> 25:40.710
about this last time.

25:41.180 --> 25:42.160
Who knows

25:42.180 --> 25:43.880
if it really blinded him?

25:44.960 --> 25:45.360
Right.

25:45.970 --> 25:47.170
If I were in his shoes,

25:47.270 --> 25:49.150
I would definitely blame others.

25:49.350 --> 25:50.610
But anyway,

25:51.200 --> 25:52.860
this has nothing to do with me.

25:53.030 --> 25:54.260
It's automatic.

25:54.480 --> 25:56.350
I didn't even know the high beams were on.

25:56.350 --> 25:57.830
It was only later,

25:58.000 --> 25:59.420
when your colleagues found me,

25:59.420 --> 26:00.550
that I knew about it.

26:01.310 --> 26:02.160
Tell me,

26:02.200 --> 26:04.240
why did I buy this flagship SUV?

26:04.710 --> 26:06.310
It's even a parallel import.

26:06.790 --> 26:07.640
Wasn't I just

26:07.640 --> 26:08.840
looking for trouble?

26:16.330 --> 26:19.300
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

26:18.790 --> 26:19.490
Officers,

26:19.930 --> 26:21.240
ask me if you need anything else.

26:21.240 --> 26:22.960
I will definitely cooperate with
the police.

26:22.960 --> 26:23.560
Thank you.

26:23.750 --> 26:24.390
Take care.

26:27.100 --> 26:29.360
Let's watch the video of the scene again.

26:34.200 --> 26:35.060
What about him?

26:36.440 --> 26:38.640
He doesn't give off the vibe of a killer.

26:39.240 --> 26:40.550
"Flagship SUV."

26:41.220 --> 26:43.020
He's good at shifting the blame.

26:43.500 --> 26:46.720
[February 29, 2012]

26:47.610 --> 26:48.300
At 7:00,

26:48.480 --> 26:50.200
the operation will start on time.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.350
Any questions?

26:52.000 --> 26:53.130
Meeting adjourned.

27:00.130 --> 27:00.670
Wang,

27:03.280 --> 27:05.210
what is Zhang Yi'ang's team doing?

27:07.090 --> 27:08.110
They seem to be reviewing

27:08.110 --> 27:11.640
the surveillance footage from the night
of Mentor's accident.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.930
Is the man they just brought in

27:21.310 --> 27:22.550
the driver who hit and killed

27:22.550 --> 27:23.390
Director Lu?

27:23.440 --> 27:24.000
No.

27:24.310 --> 27:26.310
He's the driver with the high beams.

27:26.350 --> 27:27.430
I remember him.

27:27.590 --> 27:29.240
Always bragging about his flagship SUV.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.400
But he's definitely not the killer.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.800
He doesn't have the vibe.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.220
I left my laptop inside.

27:36.220 --> 27:36.880
You go back first.

27:36.880 --> 27:37.240
Okay.

28:18.110 --> 28:20.410
Zhang, I'm sending you a picture.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.600
Enlarge it and make it clear.

28:38.160 --> 28:38.960
Archive room,

28:39.480 --> 28:40.750
find all the cases

28:40.790 --> 28:41.660
Director Lu was involved in

28:41.660 --> 28:42.690
the year before he passed away.

28:42.690 --> 28:43.290
Right now!

28:51.910 --> 28:54.640
[The World's Jokes]

29:03.170 --> 29:03.790
Mr. Rong.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.640
Let me ask you a question.

29:08.110 --> 29:09.000
What animal

29:09.520 --> 29:10.680
is the quietest

29:11.240 --> 29:12.300
when it gets angry?

29:14.510 --> 29:15.280
What animal?

29:15.510 --> 29:16.310
Take a guess.

29:17.830 --> 29:18.420
A shark?

29:19.030 --> 29:19.660
A tiger?

29:20.070 --> 29:20.480
A pig?

29:20.480 --> 29:20.960
No.

29:22.270 --> 29:22.920
A bear.

29:23.400 --> 29:23.960
A bear?

29:24.150 --> 29:24.630
Why?

29:25.270 --> 29:27.090
Because when a bear

29:27.400 --> 29:28.740
gets angry,

29:27.630 --> 29:30.810
[Global Jokes]

29:29.310 --> 29:29.770
it's...

29:30.750 --> 29:32.030
beary quiet.

29:40.030 --> 29:40.720
Funny.

29:41.350 --> 29:42.210
The doctor said

29:42.960 --> 29:43.420
that laughing more

29:43.420 --> 29:44.890
is good for your health.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.460
What were you going to say?

29:49.550 --> 29:51.150
Mr. Rong, I've asked around.

29:51.640 --> 29:53.100
The newcomer Zhang Yi'ang

29:53.270 --> 29:54.700
used to work in the Veteran Cadre Bureau

29:54.700 --> 29:56.430
of the provincial department.

29:59.480 --> 30:00.610
Veteran Cadre Bureau?

30:00.610 --> 30:02.750
That's quite unexpected.

30:02.850 --> 30:03.550
But...

30:04.070 --> 30:05.270
How could someone

30:05.590 --> 30:06.640
from the Veteran Cadre Bureau

30:06.640 --> 30:08.360
come to Sanjiangkou

30:08.450 --> 30:09.710
to be the deputy chief?

30:10.200 --> 30:11.030
Maybe he sucked up

30:11.030 --> 30:12.200
to some old leader.

30:12.650 --> 30:13.650
That's not funny.

30:13.920 --> 30:15.240
Don't be vulgar.

30:18.440 --> 30:19.480
Rumor has it

30:20.480 --> 30:23.740
that the provincial department
received a report letter.

30:24.000 --> 30:25.130
What report letter?

30:26.500 --> 30:27.630
Who did they report?

30:28.400 --> 30:29.300
I'm not sure.

30:29.330 --> 30:30.800
Only insiders know.

30:33.550 --> 30:34.680
A report letter.

30:37.200 --> 30:38.460
Who would they report?

30:45.030 --> 30:45.590
Mr. Rong,

30:46.310 --> 30:47.720
if you really want

30:47.750 --> 30:49.080
to put your mind at ease,

30:49.560 --> 30:50.450
I suggest

30:51.110 --> 30:52.840
we still need to ask Captain Ye.

30:53.240 --> 30:54.440
Even if it's indirect,

30:54.440 --> 30:56.300
even if it's just having a meal...

30:57.400 --> 30:58.660
Feel out his attitude.

31:04.070 --> 31:04.910
[The World's Jokes]

31:24.460 --> 31:25.890
[Criminal Investigation File]

31:28.920 --> 31:30.010
It's unrelated.

31:31.620 --> 31:33.140
Why would he do this?

31:36.950 --> 31:37.610
Captain Ye.

31:38.960 --> 31:39.620
Captain Ye.

31:40.240 --> 31:40.840
What is it?

31:41.070 --> 31:41.880
I carefully studied

31:41.880 --> 31:42.590
the traffic violation records

31:42.590 --> 31:43.440
from the last three months.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.550
There were 12 cases of drunk driving,

31:44.550 --> 31:45.310
23 cases of driving after drinking,

31:45.310 --> 31:46.750
and 5 cases of driving without a license.

31:46.750 --> 31:47.750
There were also unlicensed vehicles

31:47.750 --> 31:48.750
and overloading.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.420
What are you trying to say?

31:51.240 --> 31:52.120
I think

31:52.200 --> 31:52.720
our joint

31:52.720 --> 31:53.750
city-wide DUI operation

31:53.750 --> 31:55.030
with the traffic police brigade

31:55.030 --> 31:56.560
should expand the key areas

31:56.790 --> 31:58.110
to not only national
and provincial highways,

31:58.110 --> 31:59.510
but also key rural roads.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.950
The time frame should also be extended

32:00.950 --> 32:02.400
from midnight to morning.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.400
We need to check not only night drinking

32:03.400 --> 32:04.930
but also morning drinking.

32:05.270 --> 32:06.270
Do you know how much manpower

32:06.270 --> 32:08.130
this kind of check would require?

32:08.680 --> 32:09.680
Use your brain!

32:12.920 --> 32:14.300
I'm just

32:16.290 --> 32:18.220
thinking for the joint operation.

32:29.480 --> 32:30.210
Chief Zhang.

32:30.720 --> 32:31.160
Ye.

32:31.510 --> 32:32.220
I'm feeling

32:32.240 --> 32:33.780
a bit unwell.

32:34.070 --> 32:35.800
I'll leave tonight's DUI check

32:35.830 --> 32:36.480
to you.

32:36.960 --> 32:37.820
Is it the flu?

32:38.440 --> 32:39.030
The flu.

32:41.810 --> 32:42.900
Ye,

32:43.590 --> 32:44.270
you're still more familiar

32:44.270 --> 32:45.600
with the bureau's work.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.240
We're here just to investigate

32:47.240 --> 32:48.300
the report letter.

32:49.490 --> 32:51.690
Any new discoveries in Chief Lu's case?

32:51.720 --> 32:52.440
Not yet.

32:52.980 --> 32:54.790
Still investigating.

32:55.030 --> 32:55.920
So you see,

32:55.940 --> 32:57.270
we can't spare the time.

32:57.590 --> 32:59.270
Won't you help me out with this,

32:59.270 --> 33:00.050
Chief Zhang?

33:00.480 --> 33:01.680
I didn't say I wouldn't help.

33:01.680 --> 33:02.280
Thank you.

33:06.680 --> 33:08.210
I didn't say I would either.

33:14.270 --> 33:14.830
Captain Ye.

33:14.830 --> 33:15.560
Going to eat?

33:15.960 --> 33:17.110
The joint operation is at 7:00 tonight.

33:17.110 --> 33:17.910
Don't be late.

33:17.920 --> 33:18.440
Okay.

33:25.350 --> 33:26.640
We must meet tonight.

33:27.540 --> 33:29.440
I just want to ask you one question.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.920
The night Lu Zheng had his accident,

33:30.920 --> 33:31.780
where were you?

34:04.750 --> 34:05.750
The comrades want to see
if I'm qualified to be the chief.

34:05.750 --> 34:06.830
They're making things more difficult

34:06.830 --> 34:07.680
to test my qualifications

34:07.680 --> 34:08.550
to be the chief.

34:12.920 --> 34:14.530
I must withstand this test.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.429
Can you withstand it?

34:18.590 --> 34:19.320
Chief!

34:22.739 --> 34:23.960
I heard that the operation tonight

34:23.960 --> 34:25.219
will be in your charge.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.820
I have a small suggestion.

34:31.800 --> 34:35.570
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau
DUI 100-Day Operation Plan]

34:32.110 --> 34:33.480
This is so detailed.

34:33.800 --> 34:34.960
You came prepared.

34:36.440 --> 34:38.480
We'll execute according to this plan.

34:38.480 --> 34:38.920
Yes.

34:39.760 --> 34:43.489
[Loyalty]

34:40.590 --> 34:42.449
Then let me emphasize two points.

34:42.880 --> 34:43.360
One,

34:43.840 --> 34:44.770
ideologically,

34:45.280 --> 34:47.400
we must attach great importance to it.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.710
We must always keep in mind

34:48.710 --> 34:49.590
our mission.

34:50.280 --> 34:51.210
At the same time,

34:52.110 --> 34:53.310
put down your burdens

34:53.760 --> 34:54.760
and travel light.

34:54.989 --> 34:56.080
Empty your minds.

34:57.440 --> 34:57.960
Two,

34:58.840 --> 34:59.840
disciplinarily,

34:59.960 --> 35:01.890
we must absolutely obey commands.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.610
However,

35:02.840 --> 35:04.700
we must not forget to be flexible.

35:05.280 --> 35:07.920
A general in the field
is not bound by orders from the sovereign.

35:07.920 --> 35:10.320
Everyone, please pay attention to safety.

35:15.670 --> 35:16.270
That's it.

35:19.590 --> 35:20.150
Let's go!

35:25.820 --> 35:27.750
[Public Security]

35:32.090 --> 35:32.920
[Public Security]

35:32.950 --> 35:38.720
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

36:04.940 --> 36:11.150
[Police]

36:08.440 --> 36:09.360
Come this way.

36:14.150 --> 36:14.900
Here, blow.

36:43.500 --> 36:44.360
That's enough.

36:45.170 --> 36:47.550
[Police]

36:45.340 --> 36:46.020
Blow.

36:48.190 --> 36:48.670
Blow.

36:49.280 --> 36:49.840
Okay, go.

36:53.340 --> 36:53.980
Blow.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.480
Come on, blow.

37:27.010 --> 37:27.430
Blow.

37:31.310 --> 37:31.840
Blow.
